sequenceDiagram
  participant H as hass pushes
  participant C as SolarEnergyGraphsCard
  participant WS as HA WebSocket
  participant R as EnergyChartsRenderer

  Note over H,R: Clock 1 -- live states, coalesced over 250 ms
  H->>C: set hass (production changed)
  C->>C: scheduleLiveMerge() starts a 250 ms timer
  H->>C: set hass (consumption changed)
  H->>C: set hass (grid export changed)
  Note over C: timer fires, reads the latest hass
  C->>C: mergeLiveEnergySamples()
  C->>R: updateData(projectEnergyHistory(...))

  Note over H,R: Clock 2 -- statistics, 30 s after each 5-minute boundary
  C->>C: scheduleStatisticsRefresh() e.g. 10:05:30
  C->>WS: statistics 5minute + hour
  WS-->>C: one more compiled interval
  C->>R: updateData(...)
  Note over C: raw samples now start after the new interval

  Note over H,R: Clock 3 -- the wall clock
  Note over C: every projection uses Date.now():<br/>the lines stop at now, not at midnight
